{
  "info": {
    "name": "MarketHub API",
    "description": "Multi-vendor marketplace API: auth, RBAC, vendor applications, categories, vendor product management, the public marketplace catalog, cart, checkout, and orders.\n\nSet `baseUrl` to your local (http://localhost:5000/api) or live backend URL. Login/register requests auto-save their token to the matching collection variable (token, adminToken, vendorToken) via a test script, so most other requests just reference {{token}} etc. directly.\n\nFor the Cart -> Checkout -> Orders flow: log in as the customer (`token`), add a couple of products from *different* vendors to the cart (so you get a real multi-vendor order), then checkout. For Vendor - Orders, log in as one of those products' vendors (`vendorToken`) -- you'll only ever see the order items that belong to that vendor, never the other vendor's lines from the same order.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "vendorToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "vendorApplicationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cartItemId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (customer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test Customer\",\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"pass1234\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (saves token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"pass1234\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as Admin (saves adminToken)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"<SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD from backend/.env>\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as Vendor (saves vendorToken)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('vendorToken', data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"vendor@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"<SEED_VENDOR_PASSWORD from backend/.env>\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Current user (/me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Role Dashboards (Day 1 demo routes)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Customer dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/customer/dashboard"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Vendor dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/dashboard"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Vendor Applications",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Apply as vendor (customer only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendors",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"storeName\": \"My Store\",\n  \"storeDescription\": \"What this store sells\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://example.com/logo.png\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My application status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendors/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List approved stores (public)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendors" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get store by id (public)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendors/:id" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin - Vendor Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List vendor applications",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/vendors?status=PENDING",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "vendors"],
              "query": [{ "key": "status", "value": "PENDING", "description": "PENDING | APPROVED | SUSPENDED | REJECTED (optional)" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get vendor application by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/vendors/{{vendorApplicationId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Approve vendor",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/vendors/{{vendorApplicationId}}/status",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"APPROVED\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject vendor",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/vendors/{{vendorApplicationId}}/status",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"REJECTED\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Suspend vendor",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/vendors/{{vendorApplicationId}}/status",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"SUSPENDED\"\n}" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Categories",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List categories (public)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/categories" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create category (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', pm.response.json().category._id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/categories",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Electronics\",\n  \"description\": \"Phones, laptops and gadgets\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update category (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"description\": \"Updated description\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete category (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Vendor - My Products",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create product",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', pm.response.json().product._id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/products",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Wireless Mouse\",\n  \"description\": \"Ergonomic wireless mouse\",\n  \"price\": 19.99,\n  \"stock\": 50,\n  \"category\": \"{{categoryId}}\",\n  \"images\": [\"https://example.com/mouse.png\"],\n  \"status\": \"DRAFT\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List my products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/products?status=ACTIVE",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["vendor", "products"],
              "query": [{ "key": "status", "value": "ACTIVE", "description": "DRAFT | ACTIVE | OUT_OF_STOCK | ARCHIVED (optional)" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get my product by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/products/{{productId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update my product / publish",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/products/{{productId}}",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update stock",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/products/{{productId}}",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"stock\": 0\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Archive product (soft delete)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/products/{{productId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Public Marketplace",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Browse products (search, filter, sort, paginate)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?search=mouse&category=electronics&minPrice=5&maxPrice=50&sort=price_asc&page=1&limit=12",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "search", "value": "mouse" },
                { "key": "category", "value": "electronics", "description": "category slug or id" },
                { "key": "vendor", "value": "", "description": "vendor id", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "minPrice", "value": "5" },
                { "key": "maxPrice", "value": "50" },
                { "key": "sort", "value": "price_asc", "description": "newest | price_asc | price_desc" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "12", "description": "max 50" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get product by id",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cart",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Add item to cart",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const item = pm.response.json().cart.items.find((i) => i.product.id === pm.collectionVariables.get('productId'));",
                  "  if (item) pm.collectionVariables.set('cartItemId', item.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            },
            "description": "Adding a product already in the cart increases its quantity instead of creating a duplicate row. Add products from two different vendors (different productId values) to build a multi-vendor cart."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "View cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/cart",
            "description": "Items are grouped by vendor. Each item may carry an `issue` (e.g. out of stock, vendor no longer approved) -- prices always come from the current product record, never from anything the client sent."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update cart item quantity",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{cartItemId}}",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 3\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove cart item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{cartItemId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Checkout",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Checkout (create order from cart)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', pm.response.json().order.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/checkout",
            "description": "Re-validates every cart item inside a database transaction (still exists, ACTIVE, vendor APPROVED, enough stock), using DB prices only. On success: creates the order and its items, decrements stock, and clears the cart, all atomically. On failure: a 400 with an `errors` array naming which items are the problem -- nothing is created or changed."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders (Customer)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List my orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/orders"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get my order by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}",
            "description": "Returns 404 (not 403) for an order that exists but belongs to someone else -- existence isn't leaked."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Vendor - Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List orders containing my products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/orders",
            "description": "Each entry is grouped by order, but `items` and `vendorSubtotal` only ever include this vendor's own lines -- another vendor's products in the same order are never visible here."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get one order (my items only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/orders/{{orderId}}",
            "description": "404 if this order has none of your products, even if the order itself exists for another vendor."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update fulfillment status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{vendorToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/vendor/orders/{{orderId}}/status",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"CONFIRMED\"\n}" },
            "description": "Only moves your own items. Allowed values: CONFIRMED, PROCESSING, SHIPPED, DELIVERED, CANCELLED. Must move forward one step at a time (PENDING -> CONFIRMED -> PROCESSING -> SHIPPED -> DELIVERED); CANCELLED is allowed from any non-terminal state. The order's overall status (visible to the customer) always reflects whichever vendor segment is the least far along."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        { "name": "Health check", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
